[%# This profile is for outbound traffic.  The guests deny outgoing traffic by
    default, and setup-ufw-rules issues "allow out" for every profile.  Without
    it, rsyslog cannot connect to the collector, and says nothing.  The profile
    also opens the port inbound, but a shipper loads no input module.
    Provisioner::Recipe::logshipper has the whole account.

    The name is not syslog, because ufw skips a profile whose section name is
    also a service name in /etc/services.  It only warns about it on stderr. -%]
[logshipper]
title=Log shipper
description=Outbound syslog to the collector this guest was configured with
ports=[% port %]/[% protocol %]
